+/// the shared header (InterfaceId, MessageId: not used), RequestId (u32), Offset (u32: where
+/// this data goes in the request's buffer, = what came before) and the data. The request's
+/// URB_COMPLETION (or URB_COMPLETION_NO_DATA) brings the rest of the data, and its status.
+/// Other clients answer the query as an unknown text type and never send a part.
